			"date": "2021-03-19T17:36:36.000Z",
			"content": "you're always welcome Zach (<a href=\"https://twitter.com/search?q=%23doubleEntendre\">#doubleEntendre</a>). Apologies for the late deploy, but happy we finally got them out.\n<a class=\"u-mention\" href=\"https://twitter.com/eleven_ty\"></a>\n<a class=\"u-mention\" href=\"https://twitter.com/zachleat\"></a>\n<a class=\"u-mention\" href=\"https://www.zachleat.com/\"></a>",
			"type": "reply",
			"via": "webmention"
		},
		{
			"id": 1543285,
			"parentId": 0,
			"url": "https://twitter.com/zachleat/status/1583670009813151745",
			"author": {
				"name": "Zach Leatherman",
				"url": "https://twitter.com/zachleat",
				"avatarUrl": "https://avatars.webmention.io/pbs.twimg.com/d9711a9ad30ae05a761e4a728883bcbdd852cbf7d41437925b0afc47a8589795.jpg"
			},
			"date": "2022-10-22T04:02:08.000Z",
			"content": "Yeah same. I talked a bit about this at <a href=\"https://www.zachleat.com/web/image-ready-v2/\">zachleat.com/web/image-read…</a>\n\n<a href=\"https://twitter.com/cramforce\">@cramforce</a> published a No-JS blur-up approach a few years back if you’re still shopping around! <a href=\"https://www.industrialempathy.com/posts/image-optimizations/\">industrialempathy.com/posts/image-op…</a>\n\n<a class=\"u-mention\" href=\"https://twitter.com/ebey_jacob\"></a>",
			"type": "reply",
			"via": "webmention"
		},
		{
			"id": 1543286,
			"parentId": 0,
			"url": "https://twitter.com/cramforce/status/1583679932701417472",
			"author": {
				"name": "Malte Ubl",
				"url": "https://twitter.com/cramforce",
				"avatarUrl": "https://avatars.webmention.io/pbs.twimg.com/2ef42271175c25d7df7e3faaa55d67bea3a6a7804c4519ff8c0a4d83a3be7fbf.jpg"
			},
			"date": "2022-10-22T04:41:33.000Z",
			"content": "We also put it into next/future/image so not every framework is doing this badly 😇\n<a class=\"u-mention\" href=\"https://twitter.com/ebey_jacob\"></a>\n<a class=\"u-mention\" href=\"https://twitter.com/zachleat\"></a>\n<a class=\"u-mention\" href=\"https://www.industrialempathy.com/posts/image-optimizations/\"></a>\n<a class=\"u-mention\" href=\"https://www.zachleat.com/\"></a>",
			"type": "reply",
			"via": "webmention"
		},
		{
			"id": 1543287,
			"parentId": 0,
			"url": "https://twitter.com/ebey_jacob/status/1583683053540765696",
			"author": {
				"name": "Jacob.lol 🤣",
				"url": "https://twitter.com/ebey_jacob",
