				"avatarUrl": "https://avatars.webmention.io/pbs.twimg.com/b1d1b8afd3c15ddc2a00eb6993df4697d118349f7788d4791cc7129fa4b842f0.jpg"
			},
			"date": "2022-10-22T07:55:52.000Z",
			"content": "Great article. One note on lazy load, according to <a href=\"https://web.dev/lcp-lazy-loading/\">web.dev/lcp-lazy-loadi…</a> it's probably better to restrict the lazy loading tip for images that are known to be below the fold, or at the very least not to be used on a LCP image (<a href=\"https://almanac.httparchive.org/en/2022/media#lazy-loading\">almanac.httparchive.org/en/2022/media#…</a>)\n<a class=\"u-mention\" href=\"https://twitter.com/cramforce\"></a>\n<a class=\"u-mention\" href=\"https://twitter.com/ebey_jacob\"></a>\n<a class=\"u-mention\" href=\"https://twitter.com/zachleat\"></a>\n<a class=\"u-mention\" href=\"https://www.industrialempathy.com/posts/image-optimizations/\"></a>\n<a class=\"u-mention\" href=\"https://www.zachleat.com/\"></a>",
			"type": "reply",
			"via": "webmention"
		}
